  "body": "Per the bold, red-outlined note on the front page of the CSS 2.1 spec (http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS2/ ):\n\n> This document is currently not maintained. The CSS Working Group is developing CSS Level 2 Revision 2, which corrects errors and omissions in this document […] The CSS Working Group encourages authors and implementors to reference CSS 2.2 (or its successor) instead of this document.\n\nAlso, most of the other CSS module references already link to drafts instead of stable `/TR/` URLs.\n",
